ory lists each by name."},{"name":"In Jalisco: eleven northern municipalities","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential","note":"Bolaños, Chimaltitán, Colotlán, Hostotipaquillo, Huejúcar, Huequilla el Alto, Mezquitic, San Martín de Bolaños, Santa María de los Ángeles, Totatiche and Villa Guerrero."},{"name":"The state of Colima","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential","except":["the city of Manzanillo by sea, or by air via Manzanillo-Costalegre International Airport","direct travel via road 200 from that airport to Manzanillo"]},{"name":"The state of Guerrero, including the city of Acapulco","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential","except":["the town of Zihuatanejo/Ixtapa accessed by air"]},{"name":"Within 40km of the Guatemalan border, from the Pacific Coast up to and including the Gracias a Dios crossing","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential"},{"name":"Federal Highway 199 between Rancho Nuevo, outside San Cristóbal de las Casas, and the Chancalá junction outside Palenque","lvl":3,"posture":"all-but-essential","note":"The restriction is the highway segment, not the towns at either end."}]},"timing":{"peak":"Nov–Apr (dry, whales late Dec–early Apr, El Norte wind Dec–Mar)","shoulder":"May & Oct–Nov (fishing ramp, pre/post-heat)","green":"Jul–Sep (hottest + hurricane window Jun–Nov; peak billfish/dorado)","booking_lead":"6–12 mo Costa Palmas ultra & holiday villas; 1–3 mo peak fishing charters (verify)","off_season_specials":"green-season fishing packages + villa value windows; Van Wormer customizable group packages 2–200","event_peaks":"Christmas/New Year & Easter (Costa Palmas holiday premium); Lord of the Wind kite/windsurf showdown (January, Los Barriles)","fire_date":"Aug–Sep for Nov–Apr Romance/whale peak; Mar–Apr for May–Nov fishing; Sep–Oct for kite/windsurf"},"jewels":[{"name":"Costa Palmas beachfront (3 km swimmable sea)","si_tag":"Romance & Honeymoons","status":"live","hook":"rare swimmable Cabo-side beach with two ultra brands on one estate","bookable_category":"r