 + hotel package","tier":"comfort","source":"https://middlecasa.com/why-los-barriles-is-mexicos-winter-mecca-for-kitesurfers/ + Accessed 2026-07-04","si":"ocean","blurb":"15–25 kt afternoons Dec–Mar; Lord of the Wind in January","commission":"activity affiliate / lesson package","accessed":"2026-07-04","wells":["stay"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["ocean"],"shelf_fit":{"diveglobal":"destination","expedition":"destination","ocean":"primary","romance":"destination"},"commission_lane":["package","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Cabo Pulmo reef (cross-link, own dossier)","si_tag":"Dive Globally","status":"future","hook":"20,000-yr-old richest reef on NA west coast; +462% fish abundance recovery","bookable_category":"local dive op (lottery sites)","tier":"comfort","source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cabo_Pulmo_National_Park + Accessed 2026-07-04","timing":"Nov–Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"diveglobal","blurb":"20,000-yr-old richest reef on NA west coast; +462% fish abundance recovery","when":"Nov–Apr","commission":"local dive op; NP fees non-commissionable","accessed":"2026-07-04","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["diveglobal"],"shelf_fit":{"diveglobal":"primary","expedition":"destination","ocean":"destination","romance":"destination"},"commission_lane":["operator"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"Is the East Cape a good honeymoon base?","a":"Yes — it holds two of Mexico''s most serious luxury resorts on one estate. Costa Palmas fronts a rare swimmable Cabo-side beach (3 km) with the Four Seasons and Amanvari, 45 minutes from SJD, so couples get calm water plus branded ultra away from the corridor crowds.","source":"costapalmas.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"When can I see whales in the Sea of Cortez here?","a":"Late December to early April, with the blue-whale peak Feb–Apr. Gray, humpback, blue and fin whales all pass offshore, on day tours or private charters out of the East Cape — one of Earth''s richest whale seas.","source":"oceanicsociety.org, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"When is the fishing and the wind best on the East Cape?","a":"Two opposite seasons: billfish and dorado peak May to early November in glass-calm water, while the El Norte wind turns Los Barriles into a 15–25 kt kite and windsurf arena Dec–March. Pick the season for the sport you came for.","source":"marinalife.com / middlecasa.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"ocean"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"East Cape Baja (Costa Palmas) Travel Guide — Fishing, Whales & Ultra-Luxury | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"The wild Sea-of-Cortez side of Cabo: Costa Palmas ultra (Four Seasons + Amanvari), world-class marlin/dorado sportfishing, Los Barriles kite season, whales Dec–Apr, and the Cabo Pulmo reef.","slug":"east-cape-mexico","long_tail":["best time to fish East Cape Baja","whale watching Sea of Cortez December April","Amanvari Aman Costa Palmas","luxury villa rental East Cape","Cabo Pulmo diving from Los Barriles"],"search_language":"es-MX","local_keywords":["Cabo del Este Baja","Costa Palmas Los Cabos","pesca deportiva Cabo del Este","kitesurf Los Barriles El Norte","avistamiento de ballenas Mar de Cortés","buceo Cabo Pulmo","villas de lujo Cabo del Este"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-04","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-04","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","u