","bookable":"permitted day tour incl. CONANP bracelet","source":"https://www.thoroughlytravel.com/isla-espiritu-santo/","hook":"pink-cliff coves, white-sand beaches, reef snorkel on an uninhabited UNESCO island","si":"expedition","blurb":"pink-cliff coves, white-sand beaches, reef snorkel on an uninhabited UNESCO island","commission":"local operator + DMC","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"primary","ocean":"destination"},"commission_lane":["operator","DMC"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Kayak / SUP among the cliffs","si_tag":"Global Expedition Adventures","status":"live","tier":"comfort","bookable":"kayak/SUP eco tour","source":"https://ecomigrations.com/tour/espiritu-santo-island-sea-lion-snorkeling-paddleboarding-tour/","hook":"paddle the empty coves and sea-lion waters; low-impact, all-ages","si":"expedition","blurb":"paddle the empty coves and sea-lion waters; low-impact, all-ages","commission":"eco operator (Eco Migrations) + GYG affiliate","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["expedition","ocean"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"primary","ocean":"evidenced"},"commission_lane":["operator","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Overnight glamping (Camp Cecil)","si_tag":"Global Expedition Adventures","status":"live","tier":"luxury","bookable":"TOSEA operator package (Nov-Apr, 2-night min, from ~$375 pp)","source":"https://www.islands.com/story/resorts/the-glamping-experience-of-isla-espiritu-santo-camp-cecil/","timing":"Nov-Apr","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"sleep on the island — 8 solar tents, sea lions off the beach, all-inclusive naturalist","si":"expedition","blurb":"sleep on the island — 8 solar tents, sea lions off the beach, all-inclusive naturalist","when":"Nov-Apr","commission":"TOSEA / host-Virtuoso on application","well