 dawn watch","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g616328-d2391494-Reviews-Baia_do_Sancho-Fernando_de_Noronha_State_of_Pernambuco.html","si":"expedition","commission":"guided dawn eco-tour (no-entry viewpoint)","wells":[],"wells_basis":"text supports no Well — needs a human read","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"primary","liveaboard":"destination","romance":"destination","tropical":"destination"},"commission_lane":["guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Atalaia natural pool (guided/capped)","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.parnanoronha.com.br/en/atrativos","hook":"reported variously. Treat as strictly capped, guide-mandatory, book-on-arrival. Confirm the day''s rule with ICMBio","si":"expedition","blurb":"reported variously. Treat as strictly capped, guide-mandatory, book-on-arrival. Confirm the day''s rule with ICMBio","commission":"ICMBio permit (pass-through) + guided eco add-on","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"primary","liveaboard":"destination","romance":"destination","tropical":"destination"},"commission_lane":["guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Projeto Tamar visitor center","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.natalriograndedonorte.com/projeto-tamar-fernando-de-noronha/","si":"expedition","commission":"eco-tour visit inside guided day","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"primary","liveaboard":"destination","romance":"destination","tropical":"destination"},"commission_lane":["guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to dive Fernando de Noronha?","a":"August–November is the dive peak because the dry season delivers the clearest water and calmest seas, with the September–October visibility apex reaching up to ~50 m. April–June (rainy) is the diver''s value window — rain hits the surface, not the reef, so visibility stays strong and the island is quieter.","source":"planetaexo.com, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"liveaboard"},{"q":"How do you get to Baía do Sancho?","a":"Baía do Sancho is reached only by boat or by a staircase carved into the volcanic rock face, and a marine-park pass is required. It has been voted the best beach in the world by TripAdvisor travelers five times, which is why access is deliberately controlled.","source":"tripadvisor.com, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"tropical"},{"q":"Which is the best honeymoon pousada on Fernando de Noronha?","a":"Pousada Maravilha is consistently ranked the island''s top honeymoon hotel, with six sea-facing apartments plus bungalows with private hot tubs, an infinity pool, fine dining and a spa. Nannai Noronha (10 bungalows, private verandas, direct beach access) is the other ultra-tier couples pick.","source":"boutiquetravelexperts.com, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"Can you swim with the spinner dolphins at Baía dos Golfinhos?","a":"No — Baía dos Golfinhos is a no-entry protected dolphin resting bay: no descending, no swimming, no boats inside. Spinner dolphins are watched from a clifftop viewpoint, best at first light. This is a legal protection, not a suggestion.","source":"tripadvisor.com, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for?","a":"Remoteness and medical evacuation. Fernando de Noronha has a hyperbaric chamber adjacent to Hospital São Lucas, but the hospital provides basic emergency care only — serious trauma or complex decompression illness requires evacuation to the mainland (Recife/Natal), and weather can delay the flight. Carry insurance with medevac and dive conservatively.","source":"divejourney.io, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is diving the Corveta Ipiranga wreck dangerous?","a":"It is technical / Extended-Range diving: the wreck sits at ~62 m off Ponta da Sapata, so operators require Nitrox plus ~50 logged dives and evaluation dives before permitting it, always with a pro. Recreational divers stay on shallower 8–22 m reef and cave sites. Because you leave only by air, observe an 18–24 h surface interval before your flight.","source":"bahia.ws, Accessed 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"search_language":"pt-BR","jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","local_keywords":["Fernando de Noronha mergulho","Baia do Sancho","taxa ambiental Noronha","taxa de preservacao ambiental Noronha 2026","Pousada Maravilha lua de mel","piscina natural Atalaia"],"hreflang":["en","pt-BR"],"attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-20","last_verified_basis":"safety.fcdo.read","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/brazil","read":"2026-08-20T14:54:23Z","source_updated":"2026-05-11T12:32:48+01:00"}]},"content_freshness":"2026-07-07"},"booking":{"advisory_updated":"2026-08-20","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":null,"ultra":[{"name":"Pousada Maravilha","tier":"$$$$","lane":"Fora/Virtuoso","earning":"luxury commission + AOR; MoR on buyout","note":"island''s top honeymoon property"},{"name":"Nannai Noronha","tier":"$$$$","lane":"Fora/Virtuoso","earning":"luxury commission + dive attach; MoR villa-equivalent"},{"name":"Pousada Ze Maria","tier":"premier","lane":"premium romance","earning":"commissionable pousada + dining attach"},{"name":"Pousada Teju-Acu","tier":"premier","lane":"eco-luxury","earning":"commissionable boutique pousada + eco-tour attach"}],"source_verified":null,"hero":{"query":"Fernando de Noronha, Brazil, Brazil"},"geo":{"lat":-3.8547,"lng":-32.4248},"orbit":[{"id":"jericoacoara-brazil","jewels":8,"si":["tropical","romance"]},{"id":"salvador-brazil","jewels":13,"si":["culture","tropical","romance","expedition"]}],"orbit_country":["bonito-brazil","foz-do-iguacu-brazil","manaus-amazon-brazil","ouro-preto-tiradentes-brazil","pantanal-brazil","rio-de-janeiro-brazil","sao-paulo-brazil"]}'::jsonb, 38),
