"timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"culture","when":"year-round","commission":"guided-tour margin; kept on the safe Brazilian bank away from Ciudad del Este","accessed":"2026-07-07","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["culture","expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"culture":"primary","expedition":"evidenced","romance":"destination"},"commission_lane":["guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to visit the Brazilian side of Iguaçu Falls?","a":"March–April and August–September are the sweet spots — comfortable 20–30°C, still-high water from the summer rains, and far smaller crowds than the December–February peak; April–May is widely called the single best window, with near-full flow, cooled temperatures and thinned crowds.","source":"iguazufalls-tickets.org, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"Why stay at the Belmond Hotel das Cataratas?","a":"Because it is the only hotel inside Brazil''s Iguaçu National Park, its guests get the falls essentially alone — walking the trails before the 9am public opening and after the 5pm closing, the dawn-and-dusk private-falls access that no city hotel can match.","source":"foratravel.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"What''s worth doing besides the falls themselves?","a":"Two standouts extend the stay: the Itaipu Dam \"Illuminated\" night tour lights one of the world''s largest hydroelectric plants with 747 spotlights and 112 luminaires, and Parque das Aves next to the park immerses you among 1,320+ birds across roughly 143 species.","source":"turismoitaipu.com.br, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"culture"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for around the falls?","a":"The tri-border corridor: the Brazil–Argentina–Paraguay triple frontier is a known smuggling and money-laundering zone, but the Iguazu tourist corridor stays accessible with normal precautions — it''s the Paraguay-side Ciudad del Este shopping run that carries elevated petty-crime and after-dark risk, so advise clients away from it unless escorted.","source":"greydynamics.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is the Macuco Safari boat trip dangerous?","a":"No, when run with the operator: it''s a guided-only, three-stage run of roughly 1 hr 45 min (about 30 min on the water) with mandatory life vests issued at the dock — expect to get completely soaked, so leave anything not waterproof behind.","source":"iguazufalls.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Foz do Iguaçu, Brazil — Iguaçu Falls Panoramic Side, In-Park Belmond & Macuco Safari | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"Plan the Brazilian side of Iguaçu Falls — the wide-angle Devil''s Throat, the boat under the cataracts, the only in-park hotel, and how to time your visit for peak flow.","search_language":"pt-BR","local_keywords":["Cataratas do Iguaçu","Macuco Safari","Parque das Aves","Trilha das Cataratas","Garganta do Diabo","Usina de Itaipu iluminada","melhor época para visitar as Cataratas"],"hreflang":["en","pt-BR"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","primary_keyword":"Foz do Iguaçu","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-20","last_verified_basis":"safety.fcdo.read","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/brazil","read":"2026-08-20T14:54:23Z","source_updated":"2026-05-11T12:32:48+01:00"}]},"content_freshness":"2026-07-07","long_tail":["Iguaçu Falls Brazil side vs Argentina side","best time to visit Iguaçu Falls Brazilian side","only hotel inside Iguaçu National Park Brazil","Macuco Safari boat under the falls","helicopter tour over Iguaçu Falls","is Foz do Iguaçu safe to visit"]},"booking":{"advisory_updated":"2026-08-20","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"expedition","status":"live"},{"si":"culture","status":"live"},{"si":"romance","status":"live"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Belmond Hotel das Cataratas","side":"Brazil (in-park)","earning":"consortium commission on room + F&B + spa + VIP amenity/upgrade value","mor":"hotel (agent AOR via Fora/Virtuoso)","tier":"ULTRA","hook":"only hotel inside the Brazilian NP; dawn/dusk private falls access before 9am and after 5pm"},{"name":"Loi Suites Iguazú","side":"Argentina (cross-ref, outside park on approach road)","earning":"consortium commission via Scott Dunn / andBeyond-class partners","mor":"hotel","tier":"ULTRA (cross-ref, not primary)","hook":"5-star jungle lodge, 162 units on wooden bridges through Iryapú forest; note Sheraton Iguazú is the in-park Argentine option"}],"source_verified":null,"hero":{"query":"Foz do Iguaçu, Brazil, Brazil"},"geo":{"lat":-25.5163,"lng":-54.5854},"orbit":[{"id":"bonito-brazil","jewels":9,"si":["wildlife"]},{"id":"manaus-amazon-brazil","jewels":11,"si":["adventure","river","romance","wildlife"]},{"id":"pantanal-brazil","jewels":12,"si":["safari","wildlife","expedition"]}],"orbit_country":["fernando-de-noronha-brazil","jericoacoara-brazil","ouro-preto-tiradentes-brazil","rio-de-janeiro-brazil","sao-paulo-brazil","salvador-brazil"]}'::jsonb, 39)
